<div id="urduTextPath">چہلم اور واپسی/درود پڑھ کے وطن کو چلا حسین کا لال</div>

Durood Padh Ke Watan Ko Chala Hussain Ka Laal<br>
Qareeb Pohanchi Madine Ke Jab Rasool Ki Aal<br>
To Apne Haathou Pe Zainab Ne Rakhe Sar Ke Baal<br>
Kaha Madine Se Kulsoom Ne Ba Ranj-O- Malaal<br>
 <br>
Lutaa Ke Aaye Hai Zehra Ke Sab Gharaane Ko<br>
Na Kar Qubool Tu Ham Bekasou Ke Aane Ko<br>
____________________________<br>
Madina Ham Tere Waali Ko Aaye Hai Khokar<br>
Madina Gardan-E- Shabbir Par Chala Qanjar<br>
Madina Koofe Me Sar Nange Ham Phire Dar Dar<br>
Madina Daaghe Rasan Hai Hamaare Shaanou Par<br>
 <br>
Ham Aaye Zinda Pa Zehra Ka Noor-E- Ain Nahi<br>
Madina Akbar-O- Qasim Nahi Hussain Nahi<br>
____________________________<br>
Hili Zameen Madine Ki Us ghadi Paiham<br>
Kiya Basheer Ko Sajjad Ne Talab Us Dam<br>
Gale Me Shaal-E-Aza Daaldi Ba Deeda-E- Nam<br>
Aur Uske Haath Me Rokar Diya Siyaah Alam<br>
 <br>
Kahaa Ke Jaa Nahi Go Apne Mu Dikhaane Ki<br>
Magar Watan Me Qabar Karde Mere Aane Ki<br>
____________________________<br>
Chala Basheer Ye Dete Huwa Qabar Har Jaa<br>
Magar Muhalla-E- Haashim Me Dekhta Hai Kya<br>
Ke Ek Mariza Sare Raah Hai Khadi Tanha<br>
Jo Naam Poocha To Ro Ro Ke Boli Wo Sughra<br>
 <br>
Basheer Kehne Laga Kyu Tu Shor-O- Shain Me Hai<br>
Kaha Ye Haal Mera Furqat-E- Hussain Me Hai<br>
____________________________<br>
Basheer Samjha Ye Bint-E- Hussain Hai Sughra<br>
Qamoosh Reh Gaya Sughra Ke Mu Pe Kuch Na Kaha<br>
Pukaari Faatema Gardan Me Dekh Shaal-E- Azaa<br>
Tu Bhaai Laaya Hai Kis Ki Sunaani Mujh Ko Sunaa<br>
 <br>
Wo Bola Qaasid-E- Beemaar-E- Karbala Hu Mai<br>
Sunaani Qabr-E- Payambar Pe Le Chala Hu Mai<br>
____________________________<br>
Wo Boli Roroke Bhaai Ye Kya Sunaata Hai<br>
Wo Koun Hai Jise Beemar Tu Bataata Hai<br>
Sunaani Kiski Hai Ye Mujh Ko Haul Aata Hai<br>
Ke Mustafa Ki Lahad Se Tu Kehne Jaata Hai<br>
 <br>
Amaama Phaink Ke Usne Kaha Duhaai Hai<br>
Tere Hussain Ki Sughra Sunaani Aayi Hai<br>
____________________________<br>
Zamee'n Pa Haaye Pidar Kehke Gir Padi Sughra<br>
Qabar Ye Phaili To Maatam Har Ek Ghar Me Huwa<br>
Tamaam Aurte'n Nikli Gharou Se Karti Bukaa<br>
Nabi Ki Qabr Pa Jaakar Basheer Ne Ye Kahaa<br>
 <br>
Safar Se Lut Ke Idhar Bhooki Pyaasiyaa'n Aayi<br>
Utho Rasool Tumhaari Nawaasiyaa'n Aayi<br>
____________________________<br>
Basheer Kehta Hai Wallah Rouza Kaanp Gaya<br>
Lahad Se Naala Huwa Waa Hussain Ka Paida<br>
Idhar Zamee'n Pe Tadapti Thi Faatema Sughra<br>
Zanaan-E- Haashmiya Ne Wahaa'n Hujoom Kiya<br>
 <br>
Hilaa Ke Shaana Kaha Shaah-E- Mashraqain Aaye<br>
Utho Hussain Ke Ashiq Utho Hussain Aaye<br>
____________________________